      "text": "ANF\n\nNEWS DESK\n\nMonday, 8 August 2022, 10:26\n\nThe Internal Security Forces released a statement saying that the Turkish occupation army has been shelling several villages along the border from Zirgan district to the countryside of Qamishlo since early this morning.\n\nThe Internal Security Forces of North and East Syria shared the following information in their statement published on Monday:\n\n“During the morning hours on Monday (August 8), the Turkish occupation army shelled several villages along the border.\n\nThe villages subjected to shelling and the number of shells fired are: Tel Ziwan village in Qamishlo countryside(2 mortal shells), Khanika village in Amude countryside (3 artillery shells), Zirgan town (3 artillery shells), Chetele village in Dirbesiye countryside (3 artillery shells).”"
    }
  ],
